{"id":"prepositions-0045","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 45","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"after","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Could you look ___ my plants while I\u0027m away?","hint":"look ___ = take care of","explanation":"look AFTER somebody/something = take care of them."},{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Don\u0027t worry ___ the exam \u2014 you\u0027re well prepared.","hint":"worry ___ sth","explanation":"worry ABOUT somebody/something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Is there any excuse ___ being so rude?","hint":"excuse ___ sth","explanation":"an excuse FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Several parents objected ___ the new timetable.","hint":"object ___ sth","explanation":"object TO something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The press launched an attack ___ the minister\u0027s record.","hint":"attack ___ sb/sth (noun)","explanation":"an attack ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Three workers were involved ___ the accident.","hint":"involved ___ sth","explanation":"be involved IN an activity/accident."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Can I borrow a pen ___ you?","hint":"borrow ___ / lend ___","explanation":"borrow FROM (take), lend TO (give)."},{"answer":"with","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Don\u0027t argue ___ your brother about silly things.","hint":"argue ___ sb about sth","explanation":"argue WITH a person ABOUT a topic. \u0027With\u0027 also accepted after argue for a point."}]}